('srd35_magic_splendor','Splendor','magic_item',25000,25000,'The possessor of this rod gains a +4 enhancement bonus to her Charisma score for as long as she holds or carries the item. Once per day, the rod creates and garbs her in clothing of the finest fabrics, plus adornments of furs and jewels.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"— 49–53","raw_table_row":["—","49–53","Splendor","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_withering','Withering','magic_item',25000,25000,'A rod of withering acts as a +1 light mace that deals no hit point damage. Instead, the wielder deals 1d4 points of Strength damage and 1d4 points of Constitution damage to any creature she touches with the rod (by making a melee touch attack). If she scores a critical hit, the damage from that hit is permanent ability drain. In either case, the defender negates the effect with a DC 17 Fortitude save.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"25,000 gp","roll_result":"— 54–58","raw_table_row":["—","54–58","Withering","25,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_empower','Metamagic, Empower','magic_item',32500,32500,'The wielder can cast up to three spells per day that are empowered as though using the Empower Spell feat.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"32,500 gp","roll_result":"98–99 59–64","raw_table_row":["98–99","59–64","Metamagic, Empower","32,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_thunder_and_lightning','Thunder and lightning','magic_item',33000,33000,'Constructed of iron set with silver rivets, this rod has the properties of a +2 light mace. Its other magical powers are as follows.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"33,000 gp","roll_result":"— 65–69","raw_table_row":["—","65–69","Thunder and lightning","33,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_quicken_lesser','Metamagic, Quicken, lesser','magic_item',35000,35000,'Listed in Table: Rods; market price 35,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"35,000 gp","roll_result":"100 70–73","raw_table_row":["100","70–73","Metamagic, Quicken, lesser","35,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_negation','Negation','magic_item',37000,37000,'This device negates the spell or spell-like function or functions of magic items. The wielder points the rod at the magic item, and a pale gray beam shoots forth to touch the target device, attacking as a ray (a ranged touch attack). The ray functions as a greater dispel magic spell, except it only affects magic items. To negate instantaneous effects from an item, the rod wielder needs to have used a ready action. The dispel check uses the rod’s caster level (15th). The target item gets no saving throw, although the rod can’t negate artifacts (even minor artifacts). The rod can function three times per day.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"37,000 gp","roll_result":"— 74–77","raw_table_row":["—","74–77","Negation","37,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_absorption','Absorption','magic_item',50000,50000,'This rod acts as a magnet, drawing spells or spell-like abilities into itself. The magic absorbed must be a single-target spell or a ray directed at either the character possessing the rod or her gear. The rod then nullifies the spell’s effect and stores its potential until the wielder releases this energy in the form of spells of her own. She can instantly detect a spell’s level as the rod absorbs that spell’s energy. Absorption requires no action on the part of the user if the rod is in hand at the time.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"50,000 gp","roll_result":"— 78–80","raw_table_row":["—","78–80","Absorption","50,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_flailing','Flailing','magic_item',50000,50000,'Upon the command of its possessor, the rod activates, changing from a normal-seeming rod to a +3 dire flail. The dire flail is a double weapon, which means that each of the weapon’s heads can be used to attack. The wielder can gain an extra attack (with the second head) at the cost of making all attacks at a –2 penalty (as if she had the Two-Weapon Fighting feat).','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"50,000 gp","roll_result":"— 81–84","raw_table_row":["—","81–84","Flailing","50,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_maximize','Metamagic, Maximize','magic_item',54000,54000,'The wielder can cast up to three spells per day that are maximized as though using the Maximize Spell feat.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"54,000 gp","roll_result":"— 85–86","raw_table_row":["—","85–86","Metamagic, Maximize","54,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_rulership','Rulership','magic_item',60000,60000,'This rod looks like a royal scepter worth at least 5,000 gp in materials and workmanship alone. The wielder can command the obedience and fealty of creatures within 120 feet when she activates the device (a standard action). Creatures totaling 300 Hit Dice can be ruled, but creatures with Intelligence scores of 12 or higher are entitled to a DC 16 Will save to negate the effect. Ruled creatures obey the wielder as if she were their absolute sovereign. Still, if the wielder gives a command that is contrary to the nature of the creatures commanded, the magic is broken. The rod can be used for 500 total minutes before crumbling to dust. This duration need not be continuous.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"60,000 gp","roll_result":"— 87–88","raw_table_row":["—","87–88","Rulership","60,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_security','Security','magic_item',61000,61000,'This item creates a nondimensional space, a pocket paradise. There the rod’s possessor and as many as 199 other creatures can stay in complete safety for a period of time, up to 200 days divided by the number of creatures affected. All fractions are rounded down.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"61,000 gp","roll_result":"— 89–90","raw_table_row":["—","89–90","Security","61,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_lordly_might','Lordly might','magic_item',70000,70000,'This rod has functions that are spell-like, and it can also be used as a magic weapon of various sorts. It also has several more mundane uses. The rod of lordly might is metal, thicker than other rods, with a flanged ball at one end and six studlike buttons along its length. (Pushing any of the rod’s buttons is equivalent to drawing a weapon.) It weighs 10 pounds.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"70,000 gp","roll_result":"— 91–92","raw_table_row":["—","91–92","Lordly might","70,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_empower_greater','Metamagic, Empower, greater','magic_item',73000,73000,'Listed in Table: Rods; market price 73,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"73,000 gp","roll_result":"— 93–94","raw_table_row":["—","93–94","Metamagic, Empower, greater","73,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_quicken','Metamagic, Quicken','magic_item',75500,75500,'The wielder can cast up to three spells per day that are quickened as though using the Quicken Spell feat.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"75,500 gp","roll_result":"— 95–96","raw_table_row":["—","95–96","Metamagic, Quicken","75,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_alertness','Alertness','magic_item',85000,85000,'This rod is indistinguishable from a +1 light mace. It has eight flanges on its macelike head. The rod bestows a +1 insight bonus on initiative checks. If grasped firmly, the rod enables the holder to use detect evil, detect good, detect chaos, detect law, detect magic, discern lies, light, or see invisibility. Each different use is a standard action.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"85,000 gp","roll_result":"— 97–98","raw_table_row":["—","97–98","Alertness","85,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_metamagic_maximize_greater','Metamagic, Maximize, greater','magic_item',121500,121500,'Listed in Table: Rods; market price 121,500 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md','rods','{"source_file":"magic-items-iii-potions-rings-and-rods.md","source_table":"Table: Rods","market_price":"121,500 gp","roll_result":"— 99","raw_table_row":["—","99","Metamagic, Maximize, greater","121,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
